  vendorName: Officer Blackridge
  offerText: The city council is distributing premium nutritional rations to citizens
    today, completely free of charge. Take this parcel; it will immediately restore
    your strength and elevate your mood.
  acceptResultText: You gratefully accept the parcel. The food inside is fresh and
    absolutely delicious! You feel completely energized and in a wonderful mood,
    with no strings attached.
  rejectResultText: Your paranoia gets the better of you and you firmly reject the
    free supplies, assuming it's a trap. You spend the rest of the hour starving,
    miserable, and regretting your foolish pride.
